        "summary": "Between 21:05 and 21:15 the system went through a short traffic burst: request rate rose from zero at 21:07:30, peaked near 29 req/s at 21:11, and fell back to zero by 21:14. Pending job queue depth climbed from 0 to a peak of 1310 at 21:12 and was draining (610) by window end, while completed jobs rose from 3228 to 5056. Latency stayed essentially flat, no error/warning logs were present, no alerts were firing, and no deploys landed.",
